{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>RideOne Cycling 可將你的 iPhone 變成簡潔而實用的單車碼錶，適合注重騎行數據的單車愛好者，專為路上騎行時最重要的資訊而設。它提供大型當前車速、騎行距離、移動時間、平均與最高車速等數據，支援 GPS 路線記錄、騎行地圖、騎行歷史及個人紀錄，亦可連接藍牙低功耗心率帶，即時顯示心率。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>單車騎行必備功能</h2>\n<p>RideOne Cycling 會保持畫面常亮，支援直向與橫向顯示，並提供開始、暫停及結束騎行控制。用家可自訂速度顏色範圍，或啟用專注模式簡化畫面；騎行記錄保存在裝置上，毋須帳戶或訂閱。App 亦會記住最近連接的心率帶並自動重新連線。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-569-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-570-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-571-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-572-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-573-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-574-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：RideOne Cycling</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T01:58:02.104764+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":354,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}